What about cases where there are namespace imports?

E.g.

```ts
import * as http from '@angular/common/http';
...
class MyXhrFactory extends http.XhrFactory { ... }
```

I don't think this first case is handled by this migration.

or 

```ts
import * as common from '@angular/common';
import {XhrFactory} from '@angular/common/http';
```

In this second case, will this migration just add a new statement?

```ts
import * as common from '@angular/common';
import {XhrFactory} from '@angular/common';
```
